Wiser open data licence
=======================

1. Wiser's own curation: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

   Covers everything Wiser authors or compiles: topic intros, sub-questions and one-line "takes"; practice summaries,
   steps and cautions written by Wiser; tags and their confidences; lineage and influence edges as compiled by Wiser
   (with their notes and confidence levels); tradition blurbs and the tradition tree; short bios written by Wiser;
   editorial collections, journeys and syllabi; the selection and arrangement of the directory (which places,
   people, texts and talks are included and how they are linked); computed fields (depth, tiers, quality, status).

   Attribution: "Wiser (tantrafiles.xyz), CC BY 4.0", with a link to the record's canonical URL
   (https://tantrafiles.xyz/<kind>/<id>) where practical.

2. Third-party material: metadata only, under each source's own terms. Wiser does not relicense it.
   - Identifiers and labels from Wikidata: CC0 1.0.
   - Coordinates derived from OpenStreetMap (Nominatim/Photon): ODbL 1.0, "(c) OpenStreetMap contributors".
   - Portraits: Wikimedia Commons files, each under the licence named in its image.license / licenseUrl fields
     (public domain, CC or Commons "Attribution"); credit the artist given there.
   - Talks: never included. A clip record is metadata (title, ids, offsets) pointing at the official upload;
     YouTube's Terms govern playback. Talk titles belong to their uploaders. Dharma Seed audio (CC BY-NC-ND) is only
     ever linked whole and unchanged.
   - Texts and books: links to the publisher's own edition with the terms stated there (public domain, CC,
     "for free distribution", or all rights reserved for paid works). Nothing is rehosted.
   - Places: names, descriptions written by Wiser, and contact details exactly as each place publishes them on its
     own site, each with its source URL and check date. These contacts are facts published by the place; they are
     included so people can reach the place. Do not use them for bulk or unsolicited mail, and do not resell them.
   - Goenka Vipassana centre entries follow the public dhamma.org directory.

3. Never published: transcripts (internal only), private user data, votes tied to identities.

4. No warranty. Facts carry source_url, verified_on and confidence; programme dates and contacts change.
   Confirm with the place or publisher before acting on them.
